{
  "$comment": "Job Application Tracker - exact clone of the author's live base, validated by building it in a scratch base through the Airtable MCP (2026-10-15). Setup reads this file and builds it with create_base -> create_field, resolving {table.field} references to the new IDs at run time. Never hardcode IDs.",
  "name": "Job Application Tracker",
  "timezone_placeholder": "{{USER_TIMEZONE}}",
  "build_order": [
    "1. create_base with PHASE 1 tables (plain fields only; keep field order).",
    "2. PHASE 2: create the three link fields (inverse fields are auto-created, named after the source table).",
    "3. PHASE 3: lookups, counts, rollups, aiText, in the order listed (later fields depend on earlier ones).",
    "4. PHASE 4: formulas (IsLatest, then Latest Context), then Current State rollup (depends on Latest Context).",
    "5. Read back with list_tables_for_base + get_table_schema and diff against this file. Store the resulting base/table/field IDs in career-kit.config.json.",
    "6. PHASE 5: create the Reporting interface + dashboard from interface_reporting_dashboard, publish it, verify. Optionally seed one throwaway application + two emails to prove the formulas, then delete those records."
  ],
